      ],
      "source": "https://grokipedia.com/page/henrico_north_carolina",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "text": "Henrico’s climate is humid subtropical, with July highs around 89°F and January lows averaging 33°F, typical of southeastern US.",
